sage_id":"IMG_2530.PNG:5","text":"I love you too","source":"IMG_2530.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_3505.PNG:1","text":"Yeah cause Rhonda and this man gave me a ride and gave me a couple smokes along time ago","source":"IMG_3505.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_3505.PNG:13","text":"Sa it don't say anything about me and the dude being intimate in the past or now you can make it into whatever you want.you just want to start shit","source":"IMG_3505.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_8936.PNG:1","text":"then the Joey deal so when Joey calls me and tells me he has no lights no water and he needs to go to to the hospital because he's in severe pain but can't go because he was filthy I did allow him to come over and get cleaned up. Knowing you said for me not to have another man in the room and I had agreed. So yes I did go behind you back and do otherwise. But there was no hanky panky or anything of the sort. Those are my three things that I have been deceitful or dishonest with you about. There's no more and no less. As far as everything else goes like me and my stash I told you I had a stash I never took anything out of the bag behind your back and I never lied to you about it . As far as anything else you've questioned me about I m not lying to you and I promise you that . Anyhow someone at the door I'm not answering just letting you know","source":"IMG_8936.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_8976.PNG:2","text":"Probably get the f out of there before they decide they want to do something to you. Make a payment you’d rather not","source":"IMG_8976.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_8976.PNG:3","text":"Yes i know bit i dontvever borrow steal ask for fronts nothing cause i dont want to be in debt with anyone ill go without before i ask for a front or to borrow","source":"IMG_8976.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_8976.PNG:4","text":"I know nothings free and thete not going to ask him for my freedom for nothing everything has a price","source":"IMG_8976.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_8976.PNG:5","text":"Wish me luck","source":"IMG_8976.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_8976.PNG:7","text":"P.s thankyou for holding me the way you did last night that was nice i hadent been held like that in forever","source":"IMG_8976.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9215.PNG:2","text":"I’m sorry, I didn’t mean for any of this conversation to go bad.","source":"IMG_9215.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9245.PNG:1","text":"But I don't need to be reminded of them and I don't need to be reminded of bad things . It's only bringing me down more and more I was already scared when I came here I would've never came if I'd known you were gonna cut my scars open and make me relive them. You are bringing me down. I can't laugh or smile because you make sure to remind me of how worthless I am . When we met I may not have had a stable place but I had spirit . I had a voice a laughter, I had some kind of pride where to now I feel like I have none of those things anymore.","source":"IMG_9245.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9246.PNG:5","text":"Sam,... I don't know if your awake or not but I can't sleep. I have a lot on my mind and I don't know if you even care about my feelings but they are hurt. I thought me being here with you would help me but honestly I've only began to become depressed. I know I'm not perfect and I've made mistakes . But I don't need to be reminded of them and I don't need to be reminded of bad things . It's only bringing me down more and more I was already scared when I came here I would've never came if I'd known you were gonna cut my scars open and make me relive them. You are bringing me down. I","source":"IMG_9246.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9300.PNG:7","text":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/us/dictionary/english/attempt","source":"IMG_9300.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9365.PNG:1","text":"I don't want any more help from you you've helped me more than enough if anything I owe you for all of your help. I know I should leave but I haven't for a coupel different reasons 1i really don't want to leave you 2 I want to make sure your home is the way it was upon arrival 3i need you to know what I walk out the door with .","source":"IMG_9365.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9365.PNG:2","text":"At the time these things occured in my mind I was thinking they were no.big deal because there was no infidelity going on.. I 2as thinking in my mind that ng as I'm not fooling around w these guys that it wasn't no biggy I didn't see","source":"IMG_9365.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9367.PNG:1","text":"that it wasn't no biggy. I didn't see what would happen next like you told me at that time that if you don't know then don't open a can of worms . I knew I was in the wrong when I invited joey over. I knew I went against your word and I did not want to mess what we had up and tell you. So I kept my mouth shut then when you seen the photo I had no choice but to tell you.","source":"IMG_9367.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9367.PNG:2","text":"And when telling you why he came over when he came over and all the questions I got nervous and scared and did n tell you the exact truth on 2, ad occuerd that day and what led him there","source":"IMG_9367.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9368.PNG:1","text":"And when telling you why he came over when he came over and all the questions I got nervous and scared and did not tell you the exact truth on 2hat had occuerd that day and what led him there which led to more questions and more lies because the first story don't match the second story ect so all I see is your first in my face or a pillow over my face and I panic not knowing what to do","source":"IMG_9368.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9368.PNG:2","text":"I know I probably should just shut up. I'm not trying to make you mad I'm only trying to get you to understand I never intended or purposely set out for any of this I","source":"IMG_9368.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9370.PNG:1","text":"I know I probably should just shut up. I'm not trying to make you mad I'm only trying to get you to understand I never intended or purposely set out for any of this I knew inviting men to the room was not right and I did it anyway that's where I wronged you. As far as anything going on between me and any of them never happend and that's the truth. And like you said my pingen , thinking and junking have done nothing but cause problems for me and your correct because each one of those incidents involved one","source":"IMG_9370.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9370.PNG:2","text":"And that was were all the wronging","source":"IMG_9370.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9383.PNG:2","text":"I'm out Sam I'm not going to be here i really wanted to make this work but you don't stop","source":"IMG_9383.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9383.PNG:5","text":"U can have you money back from wali world to","source":"IMG_9383.PNG"},{"message_id":"IMG_9383.PNG:6","text":"I don't want nothing from you","source":"IMG_9383.PNG"},{"message_id":"Screenshot_20260521_004127_Google.jpg:2","text":"Cause its mine and I can do that","source":"Screenshot_20260521_004127_Google.jpg"},{"message_id":"Screenshot_20260521_004134_Messenger.jpg:2","text":"Cause its mine and I can do that","source":"Screenshot_20260521_004134_Messenger.jpg"},{"message_id":"Screenshot_20260521_004143_Messenger.jpg:1","text":"O.k i kinda figured it was you.So ,im glad to hear you made it back to i hope all is well for you and wish you the best.I apologize for the way things ended.","source":"Screenshot_20260521_004143_Messenger.jpg"},{"message_id":"Screenshot_20260521_004143_Messenger.jpg:3","text":"I appreciate that.Im better then I was when we met.I ran into Joe we spoke he told me I was free he wasn't gonna bother me anymore and he hasn't.I had received so many things and all of a sudden likes.I dident know I","source":"Screenshot_20260521_004143_Messenger.jpg"},{"message_id":"Screenshot_20260521_004156_Messenger.jpg:2","text":"But other then that im not sure what I want to do with my life.The road is open its really up to me at this pointe .I have nothing or Noone holding me back.No animals, no home,no dude,no responsibilities other then myself I guess.My daughter hasent spoke to me since.Im o.k with that though I feel that I did my part and I tried I showed up I went to work I dident cut off her or anything like that so its on her.Nick finally messaged me saying something about me using janey so I dont know what he was told but I messaged him back telling him in no way shape or form did I use her so it is what it is but as far as the whole kid situation it will always hurt but im at ease now and I can say thankyou for making that happen really Thankyou","source":"Screenshot_20260521_004156_Messenger.jpg"}]

